  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  testName: 
  LastWriteTime: 
  Description: 'Tests the overload of LNX_Utils.GetWidestEdgeFromPerspective()

    This
    is the overload that takes two triangles as it''s parameters, rather than a position
    Vector and a triangle. So this method is meant to determine which edge on the
    ''otherTri'' parameter should be considered widest from the perspective of the
    tri passed in as the ''perspectiveTri'' parameter.


    * Place the perspective
    tri grabber and the otherTriGrabber over two different triangles.

    * The
    operation will find and highlight a single edge that should be the widest edge
    on the ''other'' triangle from the perspective of the ''perspective'' triangle.'
  _navmesh: {fileID: 1153391160}
  AutoRun: 1
  Index_GoToProblem: 0
